e,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","number":16,"title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":5791,"closed_issues":0,"state":"open","created_at":"2022-07-26T12:42:05Z","updated_at":"2026-10-21T22:40:26Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":1,"created_at":"2026-03-28T13:57:21Z","updated_at":"2026-03-28T23:19:17Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117930","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117930","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117930.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117930.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"* Follow up to #117491 \r\n\r\nWith the current include reduction efforts, more and more forward declarations are being added. Throughout the codebase are scattered such declarations, a vast majority of which are just thrown together without any sort of organization. \r\n\r\nThis PR aims to stop this by introducing a new `sort-forwards` pre-commit hook, which sorts contiguous blocks of forward-declared classes and structs. \r\n\r\nThey are sorted in the following blocks (separated with empty lines):\r\n1. \"Basic\" classes (e.g. `class basic_class;`) - sorted alphabetically\r\n2. \"Basic\" structs (e.g. `struct basic_struct;`) - sorted alphabetically\r\n3. Templated classes (e.g. `template <*> class templated_class;`) - sorted alphabetically\r\n4. Templated structs (e.g. `template <*> struct templated_struct;`) - sorted alphabetically\r\n5. Guarded classes - guards sorted alphabetically, then classes sorted alphabetically within the guard. Guards are separated with empty lines, too.\r\n7. Guarded structs - guards sorted alphabetically, then structs sorted alphabetically within the guard. Guards are separated with empty lines, too.\r\n\r\nThe contiguous blocks will ignore empty lines only. This means comments can be used to separate blocks thematically. This also means that if there are forward declarations in multiple places in the file, they do not get grouped at the top.\r\n\r\nThe second commit then runs this hook on all files in the codebase to bring us in line with the new standard. \r\n","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117930/reactions","total_count":4,"+1":4,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117930/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}